// Test: Single-line comment
// Spec: 01-LEXICAL.md § 4.1 Comments
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validate single-line comments are ignored.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print 42 (comment is ignored)

rite main() {
    // This is a comment
    ≔ x: !i32 = 42; // Another comment
    println(x);
}
